  "published": "2026-08-26T03:17:41.63Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: first stable release of the AI add-on. ModelHub (HTTPS-only, resumable, SHA-256 fail-closed, offline mode, int8 variants, local overrides) fetching from the first-party EasyImageSharp model repository; ImageAiSession with CPU/CUDA/DirectML/CoreML provider selection; DetectOrientation/AutoOrient, DewarpDocument, Upscale, DenoiseAI, RemoveBackground/GetSaliencyMask, BinarizeAI; and a generic tiled image-to-image runner for your own ONNX models. See CHANGELOG.md.",
